9,Bisorio Language Sample | Language Museum,https://www.language-museum.com/encyclopedia/b/bisorio.php,"If you want to get a flavour of the Bisorio language, check out a small sample at the Language Museum.There was evening, then morning, the first day. Statistics. Papua New Guinea (280) - Total (280). Classification. Trans-New Guinea | Main Section.",Bisorio,Trans-New Guinea
